From 0c1c15cb3dd0bbdebd091ef74d196a904235f806 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 03:24:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(contact): FAQ as a scene launcher; restore the title;
 remove the desk block

- Restore the original heading ('Bring me the difficult part.').
- Delete the .desk block (signal path + brief builder), the slit-type title and
  the full-bleed FAQ band.
- Rebuild the FAQ as a second unit on the performance controller's own
  materials: nine clips on three tracks that queue and launch on the next beat
  of a live 120 BPM clock, play their answers with a playhead, a typed LCD and
  a lit waveform, and pulse on the beat. Playback is a plain engine module
  tested against a fake clock.
